{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484266,"name":"Ah Ah","username":"Ah_Ah","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a87d85/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T23:50:34.953Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy Grok Bot on Android is broken.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery message fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot failed to respond\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSomething went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis happens on simple messages too (“hello”, “Stop now”, new chat).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreating a new bot also fails:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould not create the Bot. Please try again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer still opens. I can see the desktop, a terminal at box@cursor:/workspace, and Chrome. The box is reachable, but the bot never generates a reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Force-stop the app and clear cache\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Sign out and sign back in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Stop now / short test messages\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Creating a new bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Android Grok Bot 1.5.0 there is no Update / Recover / Reset Agent Computer in Settings, so I cannot reset the computer from the phone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsage is at 1%, so this does not look like a quota issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover or rebuild the Agent Computer for this account on the backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eName: Ah Ah\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLogin / email: \u003ca href=\"mailto:chechuchka67@proton.me\"\u003echechuchka67@proton.me\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eApp: Grok Bot Android 1.5.0 (120)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot: Chief of Staff\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTimezone in app: Europe/Moscow\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can add screenshots if needed.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"po